<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Corp Q1 net up at 1.92 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Ayala Corp Q1 net up at 1.92 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Corp posted a group net income of 1.92 bln pesos in the first quarter of the year, up 22 percent from the same period last year, company president Jaime Augusto Zobel de Ayala told stockholders on Friday.</p>
</text>
